{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1192,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea59edd7fb93ebe9ad85528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好——！\r\n向着无敌的三冠赛马娘的目标，\r\n今天也要加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d4763b4e74f79ddf1aa10dd4e1f0ecaea345d57e33649285963b4bf67b88b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fcb4a712b38f89fa3008583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咳咳，在场的各位！\r\n帝王大人要进校了，\r\n快快把路让～开！……开玩笑♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1afb9b592eeb2a70531104eea2dea2d55f2c8e76cd562df6b09ebbdb9d8cb06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172426f64a4775b9b0e806cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才呢，来了次突击测试……\r\n但班上只有我是满分！\r\n不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0501879566b7167938bdbf6039744bd0fec5518d3ae06a2f611e2560eb737d34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa0c9135f9930bbaa6d91f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐——，见到会长了没？哎～，\r\n我还以为今天一定能在一起吃午饭呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa71db6d9a41676b1847a78ecfdad9cd6bc98ae114bb79679b0eeba47773282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ae15e24ff6e7a8b0d28dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，辛苦了。\r\n嗯嗯，今天你也为了我辛苦付出了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d85d046b5a2d50d05203bd877a0ceb212a369a020f563cb04b22169a24ffce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20761a1ae99d75aa29a58f8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员这个时间点也要外出？\r\n我呢，身体运动还不够，\r\n所以一直在闲逛呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "46995f12035833bd8f7fddc2dd4d2116f3a00c74df9b43da950fe80bb779fd91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc154984a8a1182733073437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗噗——\r\n只有会长当新生的对手真无聊！\r\n明明让我来也没关系的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f922982df4c0857b9d4250dac6233cf4fb140c7205178dffac3619c90cefed69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724531d69c145a1cbfd41971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐～！超强的独角仙，\r\n一起出发去抓吧！\r\n黄金船也有着呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256e731acb4b361dd6e7fce60c109b4b6a4e1c469dfd0deacfcb32591f63e03e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af4f0271f8ea6dba7aca102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也来试试走在落叶上吧？\r\n听着沙沙的声音轻响，\r\n心情很棒吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "399b8ae09c977b89c180deb0fa1054d52103e41e2426eb16a3f4b7dfe16ac83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7831233fee7e9adfc9f00200",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近可真冷啊。\r\n啊——啊，都这样了，\r\n等雪积起来就可以尽情玩耍了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2e94296b0486c5fc83390d5530adc0b649eb94e9a50230ec57c98f19d94b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0007d244f9f5f4a14604c0e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～……\r\n开玩笑要和麦昆一起……\r\n不过从早上开始就要认真了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d3955cff07f8ad4b5e07ad7693dd26fa82b46bc428a71faea0696db56d6ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979a3358f71448afa8696706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蜂蜜～蜂蜜～蜂蜜～♪\r\n果然早上的话，\r\n就是要蜂蜜特饮呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb5d666c94953006bc94228b8d9f1482e7401ae691ac0b35fe1ee658d7ade8b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e890eb5ca30c239b4969df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，听我说哦！我中午\r\n去后辈们的教室露了一下脸\r\n结果被要签名了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82790aa22560e278f594b3d24b39dc78118504e4a744853bb612d6d655a1605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85be3fb5a87776dda9ab1c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～啊……吃完午饭之后真的\r\n会觉得很困啊～……要不去\r\n学生会办公室稍微睡会好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0898f74f6106145fec1c87fbe82ea445ffc80ef3398c5cad6aee04a8875a3c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06295ce745d046311dac96f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了我忙到这么晚真是辛苦了！\r\n我会好好回应这份感情的，\r\n你就尽请期待吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2905e3d043f066de4387e5373cc0a174183612ae63aa4b8aa6f5a224373c5477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef7ba00e43ca4824238deb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈们都好好地回来了吗——\r\n哼哼♪像这样子关心她们也是\r\n前辈的工作♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ff1051ceeadce3976ffe287f84124335ff5ac783febaad049584973897fd89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5e84ee0d489685747ee3c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皋月赏之后就是德比……春季的比赛\r\n真是一个接着一个！嘛，不管哪场比赛\r\n赢的人都会是我就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d412516941bbab68bd1dcab885eb1c1af898531452585caa889d276ce73ee05f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3f2e055c9aeac6bd9cd930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉和大家还有一段距离……\r\n是因为衣服太热了吗？\r\n嘻嘻！追上来喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54daa7f9768a5b45bc48d4434c7be0d82600240914a9016a87286ab91f8410ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3216a4a9cebb0e1918ca45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身衣服隐藏在落叶中，\r\n谁都不会发觉吧！\r\n好了，下一次去吓吓谁呢——……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2993e315a632136575e12486bdb3da750a97ad0d2cfd97d22ee97d502d00021e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e941f3841479bbb4e87b8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到冬天就是圣诞节！\r\n说到圣诞节就是红与绿！？\r\n这不就是我和会长衣服的颜色嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c91d98ad15ddcd14f968fd34099ce2b8c5a892ec76c951ba8282b23a8bd24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6123f58876da0e597a5cbbb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef189a1064a8b6c3305659d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc076bae4d022d6cd80ac7cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起きは三文の徳！トレーナーも\r\nそう思うでしょ？朝イチで\r\nテイオー様に会えたわけだし♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9401721b4f318baf2568837117ffcc348fab8eb7f5263735b2de00fed80af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:437113cdd2bf4316dbdfd21b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うとうとしてるなら…\r\nおはようの舞い～！どう？\r\n動くと頭もすっきりするでしょ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d4f00dae2a74ac7e94dfaaa79d31c1210a0f4dbbc3fe455372347ecdba0a626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0982549386f439314841d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねっ、食後の運動に蹴鞠しない？\r\nテイオー様の名にかけて、\r\n新記録目指しちゃうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef61303049318fd42188d1f497c1b866868fd66a8d4a05e3c2acabc82326348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbc95cd5385a99d22c5454a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "聞いて聞いて～！カイチョーがね\r\n『箸使いが上手いな』…だって！\r\nえへへ、毎食和食にしよっかな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc257d96d6af6e9d0510a18f1ae24fde16ae5ebeea1f0118a91fd3588657301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4642f5c8093befb74149f147",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ていお～ていお～ていていお～。\r\n…にししっ、魔除けのおまじない！\r\nこれで夜道も怖くないでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1592ceb28c140af71468d88375c95a8839f7991d01a167f553598361b7b6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb23c5afb7fa55fbaa6779d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この時間、幽霊が出るらしいよ…？\r\nボクは平気だけど～、一緒に帰って\r\nあげよっか？…ボクは平気だけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "654818b26b95c8875810e529383546da5b4349bee83b14b0d97f17eb259ee42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ebcd176a45266914dbf8d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この前飲んだ『桜抹茶はちみー』\r\nほろ苦さと濃厚な甘さが絶品で…♪\r\n今度、一緒に飲みに行こうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d67defcb3f4f6e3d929bc2b0d1ddfe9252165cddb01bf87ea92dde70aa01568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a2f89f547738d2838ce793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近暑いね～、ぱたぱたって\r\nあおいであげよっか？テイオー様は\r\n扇子の所作もバッチリだもんね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e9f58c92a2934d537054cae72445a170fee5150a147124a6a87787d5ba81f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded3cccd4d05f2a1f780010e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『駿大祭』かぁ。古から紡がれた\r\n“想い”…ふふん！ボクたちなら\r\nヨユーで受け継げる！だよねっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d85f4e18fb25f1e29d2a87873249d8e44416195aac275630178b58871e183c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2217a247cd87888c9095ac08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚がすーすーするし、雪遊びは\r\n止めとこっかな…ここで一緒に\r\nぬくぬくしようよ、トレーナー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e1ef903075044e567bcad37bb04597557540594ada5caf35f26e0c7e823b16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a2cbeceb1226f9feb7b321a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイ～ン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fb174e5c42d8f0b63609764d837c10d0a379a19c297dd305414fbb66a75dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff7bdfaf0451295c34873085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在同年级的人当中，我尤其不想\r\n输给麦昆。考试也好竞赛也罢，\r\n我都要赢过她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92714f231155caaa3e863c897d3f800277c8916b1b5ba00b8651eac8a633940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24018642ea9616ee8a9e0766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一起去游戏厅吧！\r\n不管是怎么样的游戏\r\n我都有赢过训练员的自信哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fe6abeb50ac5dd38724507b30758a7d14f1c6fafbb7b9173bfa11983083b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63278cef10e27c0d1d66e6fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛是很好，但跳舞也很棒呢～！\r\n想让大家觉得我很厉害的话\r\n不管哪个都一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a032b0754827de026fa819a1e08a4aa685ede0b51547af08abfa24ecd5bd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8417cfbed1fdccc3835fa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸也好妈妈也好，都经常\r\n打电话过来。根本不用\r\n那么担心的啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6854c90486afb00138695f47e184f24a0e0f887e5c923ba27e0e55bde5287607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55eecfc1c563542b2d2ca6b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，有什么想知道的事情吗？\r\n哼哼哼……学园里的传言什么的，\r\n我可是稍微有～点了解的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b505e895b3cd021a7c14d2e2adcd0c0f824aa023dc09b4e9ea083d1debdeb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7698373b1a93f3ef73bb0315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎样怎样？我这身衣服！\r\n很适合我对吧？待会\r\n也去给会长看看～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d203e79086991f04252d56581854142ef2a467f97be095903303f753d501ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0d9a7a8b613140f5ebe6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是舞蹈也很完美哦！\r\n用帝王舞步变得最引人注目，\r\n独占大家的视线～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c351f8848804cb3061ed434a7074323cebf536c8d4bbfebdcf03b0d075a55687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6b22e3725c0243737d0db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标是，不会输给任何人的\r\n最强无敌的三冠赛马娘！绝对会\r\n穿着这身决胜服实现给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc39a914eb6d79ea1cce0005de44414ddcf989c959ae3bd811cc324a8618bcfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6845dacc2ff2e505c70adb89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看，这件红色的披风！\r\n袖子的样式也……诶嘿嘿，我去拜托过\r\n要和会长的是同一款♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fb8cfd94061a81880f570fa634f8e4ee4545f9126a6940fa80abfb6a93443d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dd7af705a5206898405722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～啊……昨天和重炮一起打游戏\r\n不经意间就熬夜了。\r\n……要和会长保密哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a3d1717b063dc1b4344d8906e28f0d7e9c9dfb760ef6cf27fc1f2cab217fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af794a64c2725477cde1e675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会办公室的沙发真的好软的哦。\r\n在那里午睡是再好不过了……\r\n不过会惹气槽生气的呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b10e9f54434a2a74ca9184a42e9d200f14d6c6ac60fd8e8241ed6973a009bb80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feda48a0f955575f5e725880",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在睡不着的時候，我经常听\r\n古典音乐。也推荐给训练员试试！\r\n因为它真的很无聊，不出一会就能睡着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f15240bf555bf7291110517a2eba9f0b97d2530df563f7f0460c05c21ab1ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fc2ad54875816ee2bb1177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助食堂春季限定菜单的\r\n『目标七冠！七草粥』……\r\n呜，到现在嘴里还残留着它的苦味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd59f160982b57549b1c45177004c54a4727d9ea81a6c8d38e57cbaa8c0ca821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f42e9c53fc6df264eddde3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从泳池的跳台跳下来的感觉，\r\n超——级舒服！\r\n这次就挑战最高的吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec58aa8ba81c9869b31e31210c64e7c1559b9e25460e24e549aa84024659c6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82bc8f00049139acf361993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "树上结出柿子了呢。\r\n我要是跳起来摘下的话，\r\n大家都会拍手喝彩吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d436aa9c55a29b7c40c86da096ac52dc715b42a8729e1199a488b71045512642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd80029cf327ff1a122b7e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预防接种呢……哈啊。\r\n我可是无敌的，\r\n生病什么的不会发生的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f3cec0fe8c3ad4accd74f8779f6cc2b7c4ca3a56f567ac2929f07016079c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f9016d4900054ffaae22c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质她好像还挺被后辈们\r\n敬仰的……呣——我也好想要\r\n被后辈依赖啊——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24d42249d82eceb74aaccd8b0dbfc8a60c06016cf6b490ad1b9c20591126138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c273bfecf77c7222abd3245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见麦昆新的决胜服了吗？\r\n那个颜色搭配，真不错呢！嘛，\r\n虽然还是比不过我的决胜服就是了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf0e0c9520bd9d7484c8a81b4c48b7f26a71afd2661477801980f671aad3204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73644481c7c321491a7bd953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双涡轮虽然向我提出了比赛的请求，\r\n不过真希望她能告诉我是什么时候，\r\n要在哪里进行比赛呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5205a302221972b3739ef6c1a9d82a9e879e4c68d8d1384556b900803277ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c49ef7a8b20a5aab80ab184e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王舞步的窍门吗……\r\n就用“噔，噔，噔噔”的感觉，\r\n动起来就行了哦！很简单吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "819addb0d555ecc05faa2af6bf70d88f80b36fb4cec305043cab5586b46c191b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4217c3e4f4e2a7c4032e4ab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到小北看着我的时候的双眼了吗\r\n闪闪发光的啊～……\r\n诶嘿嘿，我也该继续努力了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "79cbfe4ffa3118ed706d421b0113cc30d0c5b074951ef316725b768b61238ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8aa2cff430a50b5414a6715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂！快清醒一点！\r\n要是没精神的话，要不要把我的\r\n蜂蜜特饮分给你一点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "104413291b652d9a8cb60a5e8afa905ec917f706ec7d7bad5f9b03b2da2dd2e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd24e5813c8fedc09a70483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然麦昆邀请我一起去吃午饭……\r\n但要是吃甜点的话她又会闹别扭。\n要怎么办呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "341e723553c79be08c9f3d502d95a2d6107285b80a99dc063ffe889fc684bd00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ca6b1643bdc668eed9a720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信和太阳神有邀请我\r\n待会去卡拉OK！我和她们都很合得来，\r\n真期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54c7192659770cd5092f8c6836b6846c78b6cca9c12ddacfe348073061fa21e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad4d8f1cb24c9369301aa6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是让人感到舒适的季节呢～\r\n感觉能够一直跑下去！这样的话\r\n长距离比赛也没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d32c29b6cd5454649ebf7a8fe0848a94b683f3abf31d3c428d7fc235a2fa62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75d9c6b673c7a88d4823cfcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大热天就要刨冰呢～\r\n我的推荐是：蜂蜜柠檬！\r\n和运动相配合简直完美♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16c309f65195c7589211c95a56fa983d166699c56dc6895ff0900351244851c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180c3c8bc0403fc8efadc525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿嚏！呜呜……是感冒了么？\r\n气温这么快就变了啊。\r\n不要去医院……早点睡觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2688bf9befdb081eb4c1b17653c9cdbcc845ed6e642a7516367be82e616ea48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2899a984908f7d2880e9fbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜～今天可真冷啊～\r\n……对了，要干啥来着？\r\n把手放进来也不会变暖和哟？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce348bce56e659557db5e6c20590f0b9a72063bc3e8720903c5b3df8ac924e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafa996f73d6a9fbdd026d61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对不会放弃梦想的！\r\n这件决胜服就是融入了\r\n这个想法而设计出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c30344e6a76c0d70701cdd35d3e3ed105f2d1ce23797659bbcf75842a8dea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7605926107fd02eec2e1e1c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烫烫烫！？是我的斗争心\r\n燃起来了吗～！？开玩笑的！\r\n不过内心很火热是真的就是了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fd9c89f5106251de906e78abf21d5415dba2519ec36fa44d9fda02f563ae826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b74abd40146b45e3453e29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミってば、誰かさんの真似で\r\nカワカミコールの練習しててさ！\r\n憧れは止められない、もんね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cf588005caec8bde5a7feea05914348784725d7f2c72b6ea068bd00f58f6a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31549b11af92d0e0a3b7d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "藤紫って、古くから高貴な色だって\r\nキングが教えてくれたんだ！\r\n着こなすボクも超一流…なんてね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef009a588bd50485b40e9a72d4ca16c73ddf1f49a4b6dc0c60df596a404ba2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bdd54e9e917ace95b225b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マックイーンにお茶を点てたら\r\n『結構なお手前で』って！どやっ♪\r\n茶席の作法だって完璧だもんね～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2725f9ab6e3d9a3cf162c0f8dfc09e19a0c050a622196b34bdca8aef4e793c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8ade36e476fa8263a98e6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見て見て、服に埃1つないでしょ？\r\n“帝王”たるもの、いつもキレイに\r\nビシッ！としてなくちゃね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "181e88eed7658922ff1266964e6b3e778aa7a0068ca079ef15f12468a0d360d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b45f0c103ce04172688a72a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファンの子がもじもじしててさ、\r\nボクから写真撮ろって誘ったんだ！\r\nツーショくらいいつでも撮るのに♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5d691596a60aa26653695c565a6205517cce2f18efdabaab789989f91be7931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a057b8ccbf76f83ea32b061f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マヤノってば朝から寝ぼけててさ、\r\n着替えるの手伝ってあげたんだよ？\r\nもうっ、仕方ないな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b452ecc7478b65406d4ffefc2da3ff2ff411562fcecf0d8caa5fcd0a24ab32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9975bd0dd2f66a93a2edbf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首飾りが金平糖みたいってウララと\r\n喋ってたら、お腹すいちゃって！\r\n一緒におやつの時間にしたんだ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6100eedf123dae53767750e9487565b2ee48906daad22fe2a2302010c898fbc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cd0b1ddce8c7270c2448bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雅楽ってゆったりしててさ、\r\nつい眠くなっちゃうよね～。\r\nおかげで朝までぐっすり！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d65b9e4974ee936883315a7adb3d5aaca2d359a8e0a8f44b0015e053d1ea05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41039e60775076be9bc328a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望いっぱいの若駒たち、かぁ…！\r\nえっへん、仕方ないなぁ♪先輩の\r\nワガハイが導いてあげるぞよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6679942d6fa71518ff0a2adf355afb73d9143085d1d5b863202740d56e3bf62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0712729aa773dc04782470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この勝負服、肩回りが開いてるから\r\n真夏でもへっちゃらなんだ！\r\nほら！風が通って涼しいよ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aa868f513501fb70df47244c611265fede0d705cc30917a0ee3be1eacb6267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1331e032588bb3bef39fcd11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キタちゃんがボクの奉納劇、絶対\r\n見に行きますって！にしし♪可愛い\r\n後輩に格好いいとこ見せちゃうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8494b3b6fe3c5143a4d0f462bdeed060db7d857a62e647ff9a55890cb492ef50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df4b762da8f209551dbc9baf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こたつはみんなで暖まれるのがいい\r\nよね！カイチョー、ツルちゃん…\r\nシリウスも入れてあげよっかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "392817d4ae1cc879703c593bbc5b1d5184afbe78eee126404fc7b810386052bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652804eff9fd6d41d9f49dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫と白の、袖付き服…そう！\r\nツルちゃんの勝負服とお揃いなの！\r\nえへへ、ニコイチ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54b74326d18131c136e33018f6b59ada13efb37908b7c1447612c397d0f24d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f627d8bbc0c8225adc970269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お団子も動きやすくていいね！\r\nキミはどんな髪型が好き～？\r\nボクならどれも似合っちゃうけど♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c385dc05574a24dc3892b0c0688a555f4ed6c7a246699be17351192a95afb66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85d54886e28285fd8ee2320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐……今天的训练内容是什么？\r\n赶紧开始吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f5c015905ac83bc166c81dad836c4b322760bf536aa7e4692771c14355d101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b0c260983549ad0bd5fb0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっちゃうぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "048df81edc9683647f72e8142cceb2d12e69ebeafff0c2ecac7d29c5f6ad9c37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
